{"sectionId":"digestion/gut","items":[{"id":"digestion--gut-k001","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"침 amylase는 탄수화물 소화를 시작한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k002","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"위벽세포는 H⁺/K⁺ ATPase로 위산을 분비하고 intrinsic factor를 생성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k003","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"주세포 pepsinogen은 산성 환경에서 pepsin으로 활성화된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k004","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"G세포 gastrin, ECL세포 histamine, 미주신경 ACh는 위산 분비를 촉진하고 D세포 somatostatin은 억제에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k005","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"점액과 bicarbonate 장벽이 위상피를 보호한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k006","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"췌장 acinar cell은 소화효소, duct cell은 bicarbonate를 분비한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k007","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"enteropeptidase가 trypsinogen을 trypsin으로 전환하면 다른 zymogen 활성화를 촉진한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k008","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"담즙산은 지방 유화와 micelle 형성에 기여하고 대부분 회장에서 재흡수된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k009","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"소장 단당류 흡수에서 SGLT1은 glucose/galactose, GLUT5는 fructose, basolateral GLUT2는 혈액 방향 이동에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k010","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"장쇄 지방산은 재에스터화 후 chylomicron에 담겨 림프로 이동한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k011","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"vitamin B12–intrinsic factor 복합체는 말단 회장에서 흡수된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k012","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"위벽세포: HCl·intrinsic factor; 주세포: pepsinogen.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k013","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"CCK는 췌장 효소·담낭 수축, secretin은 bicarbonate.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k014","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"담즙은 소화효소 자체가 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k015","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"장쇄 지방은 주로 림프, 많은 단당류·아미노산은 문맥으로 이동한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"digestion--gut-k016","sectionId":"digestion/gut","unitId":"digestion","subject":"biology","text":"Intrinsic factor 생성이 감소하기 때문이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}